isoforge (2.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add Ventoy-first multi-ISO USB preparation and ISO Creator workflows.
  * Add the NikOS post-install Xubuntu recipe and bundled Ventoy backgrounds.
  * Expand the catalog with Ubuntu Server, Proxmox VE, OpenMediaVault,
    OPNsense and TrueNAS Community sources.
  * Open authenticated catalog sources in the user's browser instead of
    attempting an unauthenticated download.
  * Replace obsolete exfat-utils with exfatprogs and keep generated CLI
    documentation current.

 -- Nikola Reljin <nikola.reljin@gmail.com>  Thu, 10 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

